We need to produce proc_card.dat content for MadGraph: includes import mode[4D[K
model sm, define particles, generate process, output HJ, set run parameters[10D[K
parameters like set lhapdf? But basic proc card includes:

```
import model sm
define p = g u c d s u~ c~ d~ s~
define j = g u c d s u~ c~ d~ s~
generate p p > h j
output HJ
set lhapdf_path /path/to/lhapdf   (maybe not needed)
launch
```

Also need to set beam energy: use `set ebeam1 6500` and `set ebeam2 6500`. [K
In MG5, you set after launch? Actually in proc_card.dat you can include:

```
output HJ
set lhapdf_path /cvmfs/... (optional)
launch
set ebeam1 6500
set ebeam2 6500
```

But typical syntax: after `launch` one enters interactive commands. In proc[4D[K
proc_card, you can predefine with `set` before launch.

Thus final content:

```
